Package: PopShiftCE
Type: Package
Title: Monte Carlo Conditional Error for Two-Stage Trials under Partial Population Shift
Version: 1.2.2
Authors@R: c(person(given = "Hao", family = "Chen", email = "hche2036@uni.sydney.edu.au", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Implements a Monte Carlo calibrated conditional error (CE) method
    for two-stage seamless adaptive trials with a surrogate-only interim and a
    primary-endpoint final analysis under partial population shift. The package
    supports design-fixed and as-observed Stage-2 mixture targets, kernel-smoothed
    CE lookup calibration with optional monotonicity constraints, simulation of
    operating characteristics, and diagnostic plotting.
